# Assignment Description

## Senior Data Engineer

We are looking for a Data Engineer to strengthen our data platform team.

### Requirements

Must have:

- Experience with Azure
- Strong SQL skills
- Python development experience
- ETL and data pipeline development
- Experience working with stakeholders

Preferred:

- Microsoft Fabric
- CI/CD practices
- Data modeling
- Power BI

### Responsibilities

The consultant will:

- Design and maintain data pipelines
- Support business intelligence initiatives
- Improve data quality
- Collaborate with architects and analysts
- Participate in technical design discussions

### Personal Qualities

The ideal consultant is:

- Self-driven
- Structured
- Communicative
- Delivery-focused
- Comfortable in customer-facing environments
